OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FOutbreaks of
OL,6,Frain across northern areas, with drier
OL,7,Fbut cloudy conditions further south
OL,8,Finitially. Light rain will gradually
OL,9,Fprogress southwards over the course of
OL,10,Fthe night. Winds will remain light.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA largely cloudy morning, with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain moving southwards.
OL,14,FDrier conditions will follow, with
OL,15,Fsunny spells developing across many
OL,16,Fareas by the afternoon, along with
OL,17,Fisolated coastal showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
