OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FDry
OL,6,Fwith sunny spells for most, although
OL,7,Fisolated coastal showers possible on
OL,8,FSunday. Overnight frosts, with a risk
OL,9,Fof freezing mist or fog patches.
OL,10,FTemperatures near or slightly below
OL,11,Fnormal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
